  options:["i  Making the unseen visible again","ii  Wider access and reduced damage to originals","iii  The ongoing effort needed to keep digital copies usable","iv  How decisions about what to scan can distort the record","v  A mistaken assumption that copies can replace originals","vi  Materials that are especially vulnerable to decay","vii  Why digital files last longer than paper","viii  Protecting the privacy of people named in records"],
